      "content": "The comparison to cursed gems and hiding treasure is a bit odd, but I get what you mean about the danger. It's just that the hissing sound is getting louder and the heat is building up really fast. Why is it so unpredictable like that? Once that chemical reaction starts, is there any way to actually calm it down, or is it just destined to go off?",
